WEBVTT

00:35:29.917 --> 00:35:31.851
See, this is where it becomes different.

00:35:31.875 --> 00:35:33.851
I don't look for systematization,

00:35:33.875 --> 00:35:37.101
which I think what
organizational psychology has to do.

00:35:37.125 --> 00:35:39.809
Because you need to
aggregate groups of people.

00:35:39.833 --> 00:35:42.684
I am on the other side of that,
where I'm more looking at

00:35:42.708 --> 00:35:45.559
what is the individual
resonance of this thing,

00:35:45.583 --> 00:35:48.143
what is helping for you?

00:35:48.167 --> 00:35:51.458
What you feel when you give
only you can tell me.

00:35:53.208 --> 00:35:57.393
If it is a defense against something else,
only you can tell me,

00:35:57.417 --> 00:36:00.684
if on some level
it protects you from other states